-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
What the MIT license above covers, and what it doesn't
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT license applies to the code in this repository: src/ (HTML, CSS,
JavaScript), scripts/, tests/, tools/ and the project's own artwork
(public/favicon.svg and public/icons/).

Game names and assets. AION 2, its class, skill, stigma, item, place and quest
names, and the skill, stigma and item icons in src/assets/icons/ are the
property of NCSoft Corporation. They are used for identification in a free,
non-commercial fan guide. This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by
NCSoft. They are not covered by the MIT license.

Data. The files in data/ (and the data block generated from them into
src/index.html) are compiled from public sources: game-database sites, guides
and wikis, each credited in the app's Sources card and in data/DATA_SOURCES.md
with a plain link. Reuse the data with the same attribution. In particular:

  - Metabot (metabot.gg) is the main source; credited with a dofollow link as
    its terms ask.
  - thegameswiki.com content is licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
    (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/). The parts of data/
    derived from it are shared under the same license: attribution,
    non-commercial, share-alike. That is compatible with this project as long
    as it stays non-commercial; anyone reusing those parts must keep them
    non-commercial too.
  - Game8 content is deliberately not used (its terms don't allow
    reproduction).
